800NK ADV Link - derivative work and attribution notice
=======================================================

Release covered by this notice: 2.0.19-pre (74)
Source: https://github.com/zirryzero/app-cfmoto

800NK ADV Link is a model-specific adaptation of OpenCfMoto for the CFMOTO
800NK Advanced. It was not created from scratch by the maintainer of this
adaptation. The original implementation and authorship belong to Alexandru and
the OpenCfMoto contributors identified below. This derivative preserves their
copyright notices, project lineage, incorporated-code notices, and GNU Affero
General Public License terms.

800NK ADV Link adaptation maintained by ZirryZero:
https://github.com/zirryzero

Adaptation-specific changes include the 800NK Advanced-only product identity,
pairing scope and interface, display and touch defaults, Android Auto input and
microphone compatibility work, localization, documentation, and related tests.
Copyright in each original or subsequent contribution remains with its
respective contributor.

